	(text "ARCHITECTURE.md 3.1-3.2. The doc calls this connector J1 (its name on the IO board); on the CPU board it is J9.\nBoth buffers are off at power-up (BUS_OE_N pulled high) and NBRESET is held low until the firmware releases it.\n33 R series resistors on the J9 side for the ribbon cable. Unused 74AHCT541 inputs tied low."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
